# ============================================================================
#  iec104_tester.ancl  -  ANCL Native IEC 60870-5-104 Client/Tester
#
#  A native Win32 dark-mode GUI IEC 60870-5-104 client, written in ANCL.
#  NexusEdge themed with GlowButtons, live Point Mapping ListView database.
#
#  Features:
#   - Connect/Disconnect to IEC 104 server (IP, port, remote CA, local OA)
#   - Full APCI handler: U-frames (STARTDT), S-frames (supervisory ACKs), I-frames
#   - ASDU parser: support Types 1, 3, 13 (float), 30, 36 (float + timestamp)
#   - Decodes 7-byte CP56Time2a timestamp to human-readable format
#   - Real-time Point Mapping database in ListView (auto-update existing, else insert)
#   - Commands: General Interrogation (GI), Single Command (C_SC_NA_1),
#     Double Command (C_DC_NA_1), with QU duration selection and SBO handshake
#
#  100% CRT-free PE32+, GUI subsystem.
# ============================================================================

